    "early": "5/15/30/60m; window=min(elapsed,30) closed minutes strictly after detection. Mean minuteUSDT divided by prior median minuteUSDT; market median same ratios over all >=7d eligible peers, excluding own. Q25 and share>priorQ90 describe persistence. Graph raw5m differs in duration, explicitly labelled.",
    "novelty": "Empirical upper-tail rank of current window mean among nonoverlapping equal-duration prior blocks. Similar episodes/day counts consecutive blocks>=current mean; (1+tailcount)/(N+1) avoids100% certainty. No inference of independence of blocks.",
    "confirm": ">=7d history; >=24h prior quiet; similar episodes<=1/7day; currentQ25>prior minuteQ90; own/market>1; positive price and BTCETH excess; never previously close>=+20%. First checkpoint only for signal counts.",
    "outcome": "Unchanged original labels retained. At each early checkpoint compute additional full24h/7d from actual confirmation close, max minuteclose, time_to_max, min return and peak-to-trough drawdown. Incomplete horizons/gaps censored, never failures.",
    "split": "First30d includes only outcomes ending before boundary; later starts>=day30. Features use trailing past including early period. Data already explored: temporal diagnostic, not independent holdout. No threshold search by returns."
  },
